 (linearGaussianEnv 𝒳) (fun θ x => ε < simpleRegret 𝒳 θ ↑x) δ","valueRefs":[[2,7,"Learning.IdentAlg.IsPAC"],[9,26,"Learning.LinearBandit.linearGaussianEnv"],[44,45,"LT.lt"],[46,58,"Learning.LinearBandit.simpleRegret"]]},"code":"/-- An identification algorithm (with actions in `𝒳`, real feedbacks and recommendations in\n`𝒳`) is `(ε, δ)`-PAC on `𝒳` if for every reward vector `θ`, run against the linear Gaussian\nenvironment `linearGaussianEnv 𝒳 θ`, its recommendation has simple regret more than `ε` with\nprobability at most `δ`. -/\ndef IsPAC (𝒳 : Set E) (A : IdentAlg Unit 𝒳 ℝ 𝒳) (ε δ : ℝ) : Prop :=\n  A.IsPAC (linearGaussianEnv 𝒳) (fun θ x ↦ ε < simpleRegret 𝒳 θ x) δ","proof":"","source":{"path":"Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/LinearBandit.lean","start":75,"end":80,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/colt-2026-83/blob/3f6c0f296a3b7e4aa8fe333225505f5b2f61f9e0/Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/LinearBandit.lean#L75-L80"},"deps":[97,101],"outside":[],"external":[["HSub.hSub","lean4","definition"],["Inner.inner","mathlib","definition"],["InnerProductSpace","mathlib","class"],["InnerProductSpace.toInner","mathlib","instance"],["LT.lt","lean4","definition"],["Learning.Environment","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg.IsPAC","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.stationaryEnv","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["MeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["Membership.mem","lean4","definition"],["NNReal","mathlib","definition"],["NNReal.instOne","mathlib","instance"],["NormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","class"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["OfNat.ofNat","lean4","definition"],["One.toOfNat1","lean4","instance"],["OpensMeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["PUnit.instMeasurableSpace","mathlib","instance"],["ProbabilityTheory.Kernel","mathlib","structure"],["ProbabilityTheory.Kernel.mk","mathlib","constructor"],["ProbabilityTheory.gaussianReal","mathlib","def